  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Basic Financial Management Training Chad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial management is a critical part of any organisation. Everyone who works towards achieving the objectives of an organisation plays an important role in assuring the effective and appropriate use of its financial resources. However, basic financial management capacities are usually limited, and consequently, financial management is often excluded from carrying out the operating plans of projects and effective and efficient use of available financial resources. The basic financial management training programme aims to strengthen the participating organisations&#x2019; financial management capacity and comprehension and build the confidence of those individuals involved so they can:&#x2022;	Adopt financial management systems suitable for running the organisation;&#x2022;	Manage and control financial resources efficiently and effectively; and&#x2022;	Promote transparency and the good faith of the entire staff and towards external partners.Besides better management of available financial resources, the training will also contribute to more credibility to partners and donors to cooperate with Chadian civil society organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
